kilix-secrets (0.1.0+packaging1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Split the Debian package into kilix-secrets, libkilix-secrets0 and
    libkilix-secrets-dev. The daemon and CLI stay statically linked. The
    shared library installs on the multiarch path. The user socket is
    enabled from the package; the service is not. Developer installs under
    /usr/local are unchanged, including the single-package `make deb`.

